WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
The pill opens into the panel and Timers is chosen.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.500
The 10 min preset is started. It joins the timers already running.

00:09.500 --> 00:15.000
In Pomodoro, Start focus is pressed and the 25 minute ring starts to count down.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.500
In Clipboard, a new link slides in at the top of the history, marked just now.

00:18.500 --> 00:21.400
The new link is pressed to copy it, and the app shows its own "Copied to clipboard" message.
